Pillar 2 — Custody: Every person who touched the evidence, every location it was stored, every action performed on it — must be documented without gaps. This is the chain of custody log.
===============================================
A write blocker is a forensic device or software tool that allows investigators to read data from a storage device without changing anything on it.

